        <p>CHESS MATCH AT WIDNES.</p>
        <p>o.i Thursday evening at the Club Room, B•dford Chambers, Victoria Road, the Widnes Chess Club played their opening match of the season. Their opponents were Liverpool Central 2nd who arrived with three players short. Only seven hoards were therefore played and after an interesting match Widnes won by a majority of one game. Score :--• MDSE.,. CENTHAL. E P,ters M O'Beirne A Park invm 0 A Rimmer 1 A Midwo xi Er F Marks G J Warner B Peters 1 0 Trave-hor • . .._ 'lota!</p>
