        <p>FOOTBALL.</p>
        <p>Secretaries of Fcratbtli Clubs are requested to note that reports of matches played on Saturday must be sent to the head office, Bewsey-street. Warrington, not later than ten o'clock on Wednesday morning.</p>
        <p>GEORGE G. HUSSEY and Co. are leading makers of Footballs. Hockey, Golf, end requisites for Sports. Games, and Gymnasia. Catalogue may bo bad on application to the Sports Manufactory, Peckham, London, S.E. BEST 46EFIEK4. BRAND.</p>
