      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1893-10-28_WidnesExaminer_art0129" n="art0129">
        <p>iJARTINDALE'S WELL-KNOWN</p>
        <p>BLACKING. (LIQUID AND PASTE): ALSO "SANDRINGHAM" 'WATERPROOF</p>
